      <title>厨房、伤口与权力的传递——影视文学中的母女三代代际创伤</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2026/04/%E5%8E%A8%E6%88%BF%E4%BC%A4%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%8E%E6%9D%83%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%A0%E9%80%92%E5%BD%B1%E8%A7%86%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%8D%E5%A5%B3%E4%B8%89%E4%BB%A3%E4%BB%A3%E9%99%85%E5%88%9B%E4%BC%A4/</link>
